{"version":2,"slug":"magic-castle-edition-learnenglish-capcut-englishspeaking","videoId":"IdKtP5C7R0A","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/IdKtP5C7R0A","lang":"en","title":"Magic Castle edition! #learnenglish #capcut #englishspeaking","category":"Vlog","channel":"Learn english with me (slowly)","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hi everyone. Welcome to a new episode of"},{"start":4,"text":"Bo's Slow English."},{"start":7,"text":"Today, we are going to go to the Magic"},{"start":11,"text":"Castle, which is an exclusive"},{"start":15,"text":"magic show in Los Angeles. It is invite"},{"start":19,"text":"only."},{"start":21,"text":"Sorry about my cat jumping in the back."},{"start":23,"text":"It is invite only and we are really"},{"start":26,"text":"excited to go because neither my husband"},{"start":30,"text":"nor I have been there. So, come along."},{"start":41,"text":"We are heading up to, I believe,"},{"start":45,"text":"Hollywood Hills."},{"start":48,"text":"I used to live in Hollywood"},{"start":50,"text":"a few years ago"},{"start":52,"text":"and personally"},{"start":55,"text":"I did not like it because it was very"},{"start":58,"text":"congested."},{"start":61,"text":"We might see some fancy cars on the way."},{"start":68,"text":"Los Angeles is known for"},{"start":72,"text":"the"},{"start":73,"text":"palm tree-lined streets."},{"start":77,"text":"I don't think these palm trees will be"},{"start":79,"text":"growing anymore."},{"start":81,"text":"They've probably been the same height"},{"start":84,"text":"since I moved here a long time ago."},{"start":90,"text":"When I lived in Hollywood"},{"start":92,"text":"I had an hour to an hour 15-minute"},{"start":97,"text":"commute to work."},{"start":100,"text":"For me"},{"start":102,"text":"that was very time-consuming. So, I now"},{"start":105,"text":"live"},{"start":107,"text":"only about 5 minutes from work."},{"start":111,"text":"When I did live in Hollywood and had to"},{"start":114,"text":"drive to work"},{"start":117,"text":"my map would take me on back streets"},{"start":121,"text":"because the highways are so congested in"},{"start":124,"text":"the morning"},{"start":126,"text":"and really all throughout the day"},{"start":128,"text":"because that is Los Angeles."},{"start":135,"text":"I didn't realize, but Magic Castle has a"},{"start":139,"text":"hotel."},{"start":140,"text":"And here we are approaching"},{"start":143,"text":"the castle."},{"start":145,"text":"I'm going to zoom in on the sign."},{"start":149,"text":"Magic Castle Hotel and Club."},{"start":158,"text":"While we are waiting for our friends to"},{"start":161,"text":"arrive"},{"start":162,"text":"I wanted to take the time to describe my"},{"start":166,"text":"outfit."},{"start":168,"text":"My blazer is long and black."},{"start":173,"text":"It has"},{"start":174,"text":"a velvet pocket"},{"start":178,"text":"as well as buttons."},{"start":181,"text":"My necklace is diamond."},{"start":184,"text":"I bought it for $35 on Amazon."},{"start":189,"text":"Comment below if you would like the"},{"start":191,"text":"link."},{"start":193,"text":"My purse is silver and metallic."},{"start":199,"text":"I am wearing a jumpsuit"},{"start":201,"text":"which is a one-piece outfit"},{"start":205,"text":"and my shoes are also black."},{"start":209,"text":"They are stilettos"},{"start":212,"text":"and platform"},{"start":214,"text":"5 inches tall."},{"start":248,"text":"Hi everyone. We just got out of the"},{"start":252,"text":"magic show"},{"start":254,"text":"and it"},{"start":256,"text":"far exceeded my expectations."},{"start":259,"text":"My cheeks actually hurt"},{"start":262,"text":"from smiling too much and"},{"start":265,"text":"I guess nowadays they call some"},{"start":268,"text":"magicians illusionists, which I think is"},{"start":272,"text":"interesting and"},{"start":274,"text":"I loved every part of the show."},{"start":279,"text":"This is called the Laugh Factory."},{"start":284,"text":"Famously known for having great"},{"start":287,"text":"comedians."},{"start":307,"text":"We are driving on Sunset Boulevard."},{"start":313,"text":"A very famous"},{"start":316,"text":"street that connects West Hollywood and"},{"start":320,"text":"Hollywood."},{"start":325,"text":"This area is called"},{"start":328,"text":"Sunset Plaza."},{"start":331,"text":"There's a few boutique stores"},{"start":335,"text":"as well as some gyms"},{"start":339,"text":"and restaurants."},{"start":344,"text":"Up above"},{"start":346,"text":"in the hills"},{"start":348,"text":"are very expensive houses."},{"start":353,"text":"We are approaching the Beverly Hills"},{"start":356,"text":"Hotel."},{"start":359,"text":"Many famous actors have stayed here"},{"start":362,"text":"including Marilyn Monroe."},{"start":371,"text":"We are now in Westwood"},{"start":375,"text":"which is"},{"start":378,"text":"west of Beverly Hills."},{"start":382,"text":"There are"},{"start":384,"text":"many"},{"start":385,"text":"high-rise condo buildings"},{"start":388,"text":"in this area."},{"start":390,"text":"There's also"},{"start":393,"text":"a university, which I'm sure you've"},{"start":395,"text":"heard of, called UCLA"},{"start":399,"text":"which stands for University of"},{"start":403,"text":"California, Los Angeles."},{"start":407,"text":"We are approaching our home now."},{"start":411,"text":"So, we're going to wrap this video up."},{"start":416,"text":"Thank you so much for watching."},{"start":419,"text":"Don't forget to like and subscribe."},{"start":422,"text":"Please support my channel so that I can"},{"start":425,"text":"keep pushing great content for you and I"},{"start":429,"text":"hope you learned something from this"},{"start":431,"text":"video."},{"start":432,"text":"Have a great night. Thank you."}]}